      <VERS vnumber="7">And he <gr str="935">put </gr>the <gr str="905">staffs </gr>into the <gr str="2885">rings </gr>on the <gr str="6763">sides </gr>of the <gr str="4196">altar</gr>, to <gr str="5375">bear </gr>it with; he <gr str="6213">made </gr>the altar <gr str="5014">hollow </gr>with <gr str="3871">boards</gr>.</VERS>
