      <VERS vnumber="20">And all the <gr str="3489">pins </gr>of the <gr str="4908">tabernacle</gr>, and of the <gr str="2691">court </gr>all <gr str="5439">around</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were of </STYLE>
