      <VERS vnumber="22">And <gr str="1212">Bezaleel </gr>the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="221">Uri</gr>, the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="2354">Hur</gr>, of the <gr str="4294">tribe </gr>of <gr str="3063">Judah</gr>, <gr str="6213">made </gr>all that the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
