        <gr str="3603">talents</gr>, and <gr str="7651">seven </gr>
        <gr str="3967">hundred </gr>and <gr str="7970">thirty </gr>
        <gr str="8255">shekels</gr>, after the <gr str="8255">shekel </gr>of the <gr str="6944">sanctuary</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="25">And the <gr str="3701">silver </gr>of them that were <gr str="6485">numbered </gr>of the <gr str="5712">congregation </gr>
