        <gr str="8255">shekels</gr>, after the <gr str="8255">shekel </gr>of the <gr str="6944">sanctuary</gr>:</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="26">A <gr str="1235">bekah </gr>for every <gr str="1538">man</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">that is</STYLE>, <gr str="4276">half </gr>a <gr str="8255">shekel</gr>, after the <gr str="8255">shekel </gr>of the <gr str="6944">sanctuary</gr>, for every one that <gr str="5674">went </gr>to be <gr str="6485">numbered</gr>, from <gr str="6242">twenty </gr>
